    "title": "Utilizzo dei metodi degli oggetti",
    "descriptionContent": "Scopri come interagire con le proprietà e rappresentare i comportamenti del mondo reale usando i metodi.",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17521,
        "title": "Metodi degli oggetti",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148590,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A volte abbiamo funzioni strettamente correlate ai nostri oggetti di gioco. Ad esempio, una funzione <code>jump()</code> correlata a un oggetto <code>player</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"jump\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;player jumps!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"jump();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>jump</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148591,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Analogamente alle proprietà, possiamo raggruppare funzioni correlate negli oggetti. Le funzioni all'interno di un oggetto sono chiamate <strong>metodi</strong> dell'oggetto.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"54\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\" : \" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"jump\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\" : \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>jump : function() {}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148592,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Creiamo i metodi degli oggetti come le proprietà, iniziando con un nome e due punti <code>:</code>, seguiti dalla parola chiave <code>function</code>, da <code>()</code> e dalle parentesi graffe <code>{}</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"jump\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>function</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148593,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiamiamo questi metodi con il nome dell'oggetto, un <code>.</code> e il nome del metodo seguito dalle parentesi <code>()</code>, come in <code>player.jump();</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"104\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"jump\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;player jumps!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.jump();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>player</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>jump</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148594,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I metodi sono simili alle funzioni normali. Ciò significa che possiamo includere anche parametri e istruzioni <code>return</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"72\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"scoreMessage\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"points\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score +&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + points;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player.scoreMessage(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>function(points)</code>, seguito da <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148595,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come chiamiamo le funzioni all'interno di un oggetto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">I metodi dell'oggetto</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Le funzioni dell'oggetto</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">I metodi dell'oggetto.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148596,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assembla il codice per creare il metodo dell'oggetto.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"62\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hp\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"attack\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>attack</code>, seguito da <code>:</code> e poi <code>function</code>, <code>()</code>, <code>{}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148597,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come diresti all'oggetto <code>enemy</code> di eseguire il metodo <code>attack</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"attack\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime attacks!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>enemy.attack()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>enemy.attack</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>enemy.attack()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148598,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inserisci la parola chiave mancante per creare un metodo.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"60\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\" : \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hp\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\" : \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"attack\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\" : \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>function</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148599,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale parola chiave usiamo per definire un metodo?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>function</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>method</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>function</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148600,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assembla il codice per chiamare il metodo <code>attack</code> dell'oggetto <code>enemy</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"call\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"116\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hp\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"attack\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime attacks!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemy.attack();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>enemy</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>attack</code>, <code>()</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148601,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I metodi possono usare parametri e istruzioni <code>return</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sì</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Sì.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148602,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi il parametro mancante al metodo.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Slime\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"player\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"74\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hp\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"takeDamage\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"damageAmount\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Damage taken: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + damageAmount);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>damageAmount</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17522,
        "title": "Utilizzo dei metodi",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148603,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Impariamo a usare i metodi per accedere e aggiornare le proprietà del nostro oggetto.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"99\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hero&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hero&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.display();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>player.display();</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148604,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La parola chiave <code>this</code> fa riferimento all'oggetto che contiene il metodo. In questo caso, <code>player</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hero&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.display();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>this</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148605,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare <code>this</code> seguito da un <code>.</code> per accedere alle proprietà dell'oggetto dall'interno dei suoi metodi.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"78\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hero&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.display();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>this</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148606,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Allo stesso modo, possiamo usare <code>this</code> seguito da un <code>.</code> per aggiornare le proprietà dell'oggetto dall'interno dei suoi metodi.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"87\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hero&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"changeAndDisplay\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Knight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.changeAndDisplay();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>this.name</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e poi <code>\"Knight\"</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148607,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La parola chiave <code>this</code> può essere usata per accedere alle proprietà di un oggetto solo <strong>all'interno</strong> del metodo dell'oggetto.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option startIndex=\"120\" endIndex=\"126\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hero&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"changeAndDisplay\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Knight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.changeAndDisplay();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>this</code>, seguito da <code>this</code> e infine <code>player</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148608,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale parola chiave possiamo usare per fare riferimento all'oggetto che contiene il metodo?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>this</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>that</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>this</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148609,
